# whitelist: scripts, notes and small text results only (trajectories, maps, models stay local)
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.csh
!*.com
!*.sh
!*.py
!*.awk
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.sourceme
!*.in
# a copy of the bespoke_amber_restraints repo, already on GitHub
water_models/repo_scan/
water_models/repo_*/
temp_*
!phenix_check/*.out
!water_models/addwater/*.log
!water_models/scan/*.log
# own clone of bespoke_amber_restraints (its own git repo)
bespoke_amber_restraints/
